# Token efficiency (genai_pdn)

- Prefer grep and semantic search over full-file reads; use line ranges when reading files.
- Do not read ignored paths: datasets/, checkpoints/, experiments/, `*.pt`, `*.pth`, and other entries in `.cursorignore`.
- Start a new chat for unrelated tasks instead of carrying long debugging history.
- Use Exa (`web_search_exa`, `web_fetch_exa`) for web lookup; skip browser MCP unless UI testing is required.
- Do not use Figma MCP in this project (design work is out of scope).
- Minimize MCP tool calls; use only what the task needs.
